es left. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $4$ squares right. Thus $OX=\\frac{3}{2}|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $6$ squares right and $3$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=3|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=3\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}+3\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-\\frac{3}{2}$ and $\\mu=3$." 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761146 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761163 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761146 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761146 1077 "field-1" 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761146 1078 #edb/ref 17592186761163 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761146 1079 #uuid "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad" 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761147 1080 "-1" 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761147 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761147 1083 #uuid "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b" 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761148 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761162 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761148 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761148 1077 "field-2" 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761148 1078 #edb/ref 17592186761162 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761148 1079 #uuid "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f" 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761149 1080 "-\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139547581 17592186576411 true] [17592186761149 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 